OL,3,GNEWSAEnvironmentally friendly e-bikes
OL,4,A'a hazard for pedestrians'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor the past five months, you might
OL,7,Fhave seen Lime's bright green e-bikes
OL,8,Fzipping through Wolverhampton city
OL,9,Fcentre.
OL,11,FThe shared e-bike firm launched in the
OL,12,Fcity in June, with Councillor Bhupinder
OL,13,FGakhal saying approximately 1,100 to
OL,14,F2,600 trips take place in Wolverhampton
OL,15,Fevery week.
OL,17,FBut the form of transport has proved
OL,18,Fcontroversial nationwide.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
