OL,3,GNEWSAEnvironmentally friendly e-bikes
OL,4,A'a hazard for pedestrians'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMayor of London Sadiq Khan described
OL,7,Fthe approach to dockless e-bikes as a
OL,8,F"wild west", saying it could no longer
OL,9,Fcontinue.
